OL,3,GNEWSAPublic need to 'report anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-social behaviour is falling in a
OL,7,Fcounty despite a number of recent
OL,8,Fproblems, a police, fire and crime
OL,9,Fcommissioner (PCC) has said.
OL,11,FDavid Allen was speaking to Radio
OL,12,FCumbria following incidents of disorder
OL,13,Finvolving groups of teenagers in
OL,14,FCarlisle city centre on Saturday, as
OL,15,Fwell as issues in the past few weeks in
OL,16,FWorkington and Egremont.
OL,18,FHe said while he was not downplaying
OL,19,Flocal concerns, figures showed recorded
OL,20,Fanti-social behaviour had gone down
OL,21,Fmore than 30% in the past year.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
