OL,3,GNEWSAPublic need to 'report anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also urged people to report
OL,7,Fincidents to the police, rather than
OL,8,Fcomplain on social media, which can
OL,9,Fmake the problem appear greater than it
OL,10,Fis if posts are widely shared.
